 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-17","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.83","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.83/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"6dcf8c448dc7f44c583586385fc09d7ef94710bc5b2f07093c7244cbfd86820a"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.83/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"2282f9762c914043515f08ce9c40be6d5917192f61534decd3c2f8c3bfa0a05f"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.83/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"4adb41a454a3877f4e76839c0104be56582a53f01c4da10cc367511e022b1b12"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.83/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"0034cba1c8d9451b1e3cfe201c830723e105a0a30c9bb2b858b5b8740836afe1"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.83"}